  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour Rights for Independent Journalism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project has three specific objectives with regard to : 1) a fundamental problem concerning the consolidation of self-organization capacities of journalists and media workers on national and local levels; 2) &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;concerning the compliance of the management of the media organisations with the basic requirements for decent pay and working conditions of journalists and media workers and 3) urgent problems arising from insufficiently clear legislation and absence of political will for journalists economic and social rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
